The v4.0 entry form's wiring fixes and UI refresh, planned in [`v4.0/handoff/README.md`](v4.0/handoff/README.md), are **implemented and verified (2026-09-14) but not committed**. Don't run the handoff again; the handoff folder now only explains the plan and how it was checked.

Also uncommitted: `server.jl`'s window launcher ("Launching the UI"), merged back in on 2026-09-14 from an older copy the owner kept at `E:\version.jl`.

Also uncommitted (2026-09-15): the Review and Saved screens are removed.
- Saving writes each day straight to the books (`POST /api/save`).
- `Staging.jl` and the notepad endpoints are deleted.
- The "first day on record" and "replace ledger file" tick boxes are in the dock.
- "Edit that day" loads a saved day back (`GET /api/day`).

Also uncommitted (2026-09-15): each difference has its own reason.
- An opening that doesn't match the last close (L2-B) is explained in a reason box in Start of day. It is sent as `openingReason` and stored in a new Daily Journal column, "Opening Reason".
- A day that doesn't balance (L2-A) is still explained in End of day, as `reason`, in the "Reason" column.
- `Checks.unexplained` refuses a day unless each difference has its own reason.

