- **Live again, in a new form (2026-09-16):** `Notify.jl`, `notify.example.toml` and `tests/test_notify.jl`. The instant per-save emails are gone; what replaces them is one daily report (see the 2026-09-16 bullet below). `main.jl` includes `Notify.jl`, so it is no longer an orphan.
